{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/close()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"close","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A6ClientC5closeyyYaKF","title":"close()","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/close()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Deterministic shutdown (CONTRACT.md §18)."}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"close","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Releases the HTTP client and its connection pool, and clears the cookie jar, the CSRF token"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and any retained "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Sensitive"},{"type":"text","text":" challenge token (§18.1 rule 6)."}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Idempotent"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (rule 2): calling it twice is a no-op the second time. Cleanup code runs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from error paths, and an error path that itself throws hides the original failure."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Does not log out"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (rule 5): it issues no request. The server-side session deliberately"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"outlives the client object — that is what lets a process restart and resume — so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"close()"},{"type":"text","text":" that logged out would silently end every user’s session on each deploy."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use after close is an error, not undefined"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (rule 4): every operation afterwards"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"throws "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/NetworkError","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" naming the cause rather than silently reopening."}]}]}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deinit"},{"type":"text","text":" cannot "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"await"},{"type":"text","text":", and releasing an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncHTTPClient"},{"type":"text","text":" is async, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this SDK cannot make deallocation a complete shutdown the way §18.1 rule 1’s “a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deinit"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"plus explicit "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"close()"},{"type":"text","text":"” suggests. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"close()"},{"type":"text","text":" is therefore the only complete form, and is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stated as required rather than implied."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AxiamClient"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"actor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AxiamClient"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The AXIAM REST client (§1–§7, §9 of CONTRACT.md)."}],"title":"AxiamClient","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/Sensitive":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Sensitive","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A wrapper for secret material (§7 of CONTRACT.md)."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sensitive","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Sensitive","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/sensitive","role":"symbol","title":"Sensitive"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/NetworkError":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/NetworkError","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Transport-level failure (§2). Carries the underlying transport error as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cause"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"where one exists (connection refused, timeout, TLS handshake failure, DNS)."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NetworkError","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"NetworkError","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/networkerror","role":"symbol","title":"NetworkError"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"abstract":[{"text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management).","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","title":"AxiamSDK","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient/close()":{"title":"close()","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/close()","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/close()","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"close"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Deterministic shutdown (CONTRACT.md §18)."}]}}}